# xs context test read of the same seed, grain and probe (`--prior-rung-record <ledger sha256>`).
# Inputs on the box (input_artifacts): input/s-latent-s4/model (the frozen backbone directory of
# the landed seed-4 Job V) and input/s-latent-s4/pretrain-run/results.json (the pretrain record
# annotate reads). One command per line; the runner's cwd is the harness directory; set -e stops
# at the first failure. Results land under results-context/ (never results/).
